story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Edgecombe County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair came in at 50% of normal, and August to September at 52%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 50% of normal and June to July at 103%.</p>"}
